{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VS CTA (Voxblock vs Yoto page)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The page's one call to action, used everywhere a button appears (hero, comparison table + its sticky header, price
breakdown cards): the theme's own primary button (pill, site orange, white text) reading "Shop now" and linking to
the starter pack collection. Slim on cards; the page-level buttons (hero, closing band) are full size.

Variables:
* collection: the collection to link to [REQUIRED]
* text: button text. Defaults to "Shop now".
* show_from: true to add " · from £x" (the cheapest product in the collection, live). Default false.
* full: true for the full-size button. Default is the slim one used on cards and in the sticky header.
* track: PostHog target name, sent as vs_yoto_click { target, page } (voxblock.js).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign from_cents = 0
  assign from_cents_any = 0
  for item in collection.products
    if item.price_min > 0
      if from_cents_any == 0 or item.price_min < from_cents_any
        assign from_cents_any = item.price_min
      endif
      if item.available
        if from_cents == 0 or item.price_min < from_cents
          assign from_cents = item.price_min
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  if from_cents == 0
    assign from_cents = from_cents_any
  endif
  assign label = text | default: 'Shop now'
-%}

<a class="button {% if full %}button--lg{% else %}button--sm{% endif %} w-full vs-cta{% unless full %} vs-cta--slim{% endunless %}" href="{{ collection.url }}" data-vs-track="{{ track | default: 'cta' }}">
  {{- label | escape -}}
  {%- if show_from and from_cents > 0 -%}<span class="vs-cta__from"> · from {{ from_cents | money }}</span>{%- endif -%}
</a>
